	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Adapting to your environment is crucial to survival. Choose one of the following benefits:</p><p><strong>Ashfall:</strong> The skies of your world are blackened.  You gain darkvision 60ft.</p><p><strong>Desolate:</strong> You automatically succeed on saving throws to resist the effects of environments with extreme heat.</p><p><strong>Iceball:</strong> You automatically succeed on saving throws to resist the effects of environments with extreme cold.</p><p><strong>Waterworld:</strong> You gain expertise on swimming checks and can hold your breath for 10 minutes.</p>",
